* keying_a5_sweep1.cir: keying envelope loop, TS-012 finalist A5 (RA07M1317M module, VGG loop), revision 1 design, threshold sweep at 7.4 V pack
* cwht WP-PDR-22 pre-order item; generated by hardware/sim/tx-keying/keying_run.py; record
* docs/design/analysis/keying-ts012.md. Envelope-domain behavioural deck (no RF carrier).
* Steps: for each corner in turn, the packs [7.4] V (drain [6.7] V),
* within each the power steps [0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 5.0] W, within each the 3, 5, 8 ms (10-90 %) settings:
*   runs 1..12: PA curve shifted -0.300 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 13..24: PA curve shifted -0.250 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 25..36: PA curve shifted -0.200 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 37..48: PA curve shifted -0.150 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 49..60: PA curve shifted -0.100 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 61..72: PA curve shifted -0.050 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 73..84: PA curve shifted +0.000 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 85..96: PA curve shifted +0.050 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 97..108: PA curve shifted +0.100 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 109..120: PA curve shifted +0.150 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 121..132: PA curve shifted +0.200 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 133..144: PA curve shifted +0.250 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
*   runs 145..156: PA curve shifted +0.300 V, error-amplifier offset +0.0 mV
* 50 WPM continuous dits: key down 24 ms, up 24 ms; relay command at key-down of element 1,
* contact closed at 7.5 ms; CLK1 and GVA-84+ bias on at 8 ms; ramp start 10 ms after each key-down;
* drive gated off 1 ms after each ramp end; VGG and integrator clamps applied at the gate.
